    <briefdescription>
<para>Client input poll: dequeue one routed event for a surface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A client fills <computeroutput>size</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>surface_id</computeroutput> and issues <computeroutput>RAD_DEVICE_IOCTL_COMPOSITOR_POLL_INPUT</computeroutput>. The compositor sets <computeroutput>has_event</computeroutput> to 1 and populates <computeroutput>event</computeroutput> when an event was waiting, or 0 when the per-surface input queue is empty. Pointer coordinates in <computeroutput>event</computeroutput> are surface-local. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
